 "contract": "scripts/activities/world_jobs/CONTRACT.md. JobBoard (server) owns offers (ReplicatedStorage.ActivityState.JobOffers, runtime only), JobAccept validation, trips, crashes, arrival, settlement and the single payout per trip via ActivityPayout.Pay (TaxiFare / JobPayout, CommandId <Kind>:<TripId>:<UserId>, JobCeiling). TaxiJob/CourierJob register their ActivityService kinds and providers (taxi NPC rigs via PassengerService.SeatNpc/UnseatNpc). JobRules (shared pure) holds all maths. Client (JobClient + views) presentation and JobAccept intent only. Integrator: ActivityService ACTIONS += JobAccept (remove CourierGoToHub, CourierStart, TaxiSetDuty, TaxiRequest, TaxiCancelRequest, TaxiAcceptRequest); ServerBase entry JobBoard {ActivityService, ProgressionService} and add JobBoard to CourierJob/TaxiJob dependencies; delete Workspace.World.Jobs (courier hub pads). No saved-data or schema change.",
